# Locus of Enlightenment "has each activated ability of the exiled cards used to craft it" (CR 702.167c), however many:
# crafted on turn 9 with Walking Ballista (two abilities), Aether Spellbomb (two), Pyrite Spellbomb (two), Mind Stone (two)
# and Goblin Bombardment (one), it has nine besides its own trigger. The last of them, granted after the other eight, are
# usable: on turn 11 Bot1 activates the Bombardment's (Bot2 takes 1, and 1 from the copy), then Mind Stone's
# "{1}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card", which sacrifices Locus as its cost: Locus is gone by the time the
# ability is activated (CR 602.2b, 601.2i), so it does not trigger (the Rings of Brighthearth ruling) and Bot1 draws one.

